# Watch it compile

:::box{class=lead}
The compiler runs in this tab. Nothing you type is sent anywhere — `@hymarkx/compiler` has no
server half, so the page loads it and calls it. Edit the left, and the right updates: the HTML,
the CSS, the JavaScript, and what each actually costs gzipped.
:::

::::

::::box{as=section class=play-mount #playground}

::island{from="./islands/play.js" export="Play"}

::::

::::box{as=section class="chapter reveal"}

:::box{class=eyebrow}
What to try
:::

## Things worth deleting

:::box{class=lead}
Delete the `:::note` and watch the CSS shrink — component styles are emitted only for the
components a document uses. Delete the `::state` line and the JavaScript goes to zero, not to a
smaller runtime. Then put them back.
:::

:::box{class=lead}
The URL updates as you type, so whatever you end up with is a link you can send someone.
:::

